    /** 朋友圈伪点赞：长按那条动态 = 本地标记为已伪赞 + 记一条，不发请求；短按/其它操作都不受影响 */
    public static void snsAutoFakeLike(final View view) {
        try {
            if (!cfg().optBoolean("fakeLike", false)) return;
            final String txt = collectText(view);
            if (txt == null || txt.length() == 0) return;
            // 只处理真正的动态卡片：要有头像、要像一条动态（有作者/正文/时间），封面和列表壳子跳过
            if (!containsAvatar(view)) return;
            org.json.JSONArray fn = cfg().optJSONArray("fakeLikeNames");
            if (fn != null && fn.length() > 0) {
                boolean hit = false;
                for (int i = 0; i < fn.length(); i++) {
                    String n = fn.optString(i, "");
                    if (n.length() > 0 && txt.contains(n)) { hit = true; break; }
                }
                if (!hit) return;
            }
            if (Boolean.TRUE.equals(view.getTag(0x0f0f0f62))) return;   // 已挂过
            view.setTag(0x0f0f0f62, Boolean.TRUE);
            view.setLongClickable(true);
            view.setOnLongClickListener(new View.OnLongClickListener() {
                @Override public boolean onLongClick(View v) {
                    try {
                        fakeBlockUntil = System.currentTimeMillis() + 1500L;
                        fakeLikeRecord(txt);
                        v.setBackgroundColor(0x1AE5484D);   // 淡红底，一眼看出这条已伪赞
                        View like = findLikeButton(v);
                        if (like != null) markLiked(like);
                        toast("伪赞成功：仅本地标记，没发出去，对方无感知");
                        likeFakeStats++;
                        log("FAKELIKE|longpress count=" + likeFakeStats + " " + (txt.length() > 20 ? txt.substring(0, 20) : txt));
                    } catch (Throwable t) { log("FAKELIKE|long err " + t); }
                    return true;   // 吃掉长按，避免同时触发原生长按菜单
                }
            });
            log("FAKELIKE|hooked longpress");
        } catch (Throwable t) { log("FAKELIKE|err " + t); }
    }

    private static void showFakeLiked(final android.app.Activity a) {
        try {
            org.json.JSONArray fl = cfg().optJSONArray("fakeLiked");
            if (fl == null || fl.length() == 0) { toast("还没有伪赞记录"); return; }
            StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();
            int shown = 0;
            for (int i = fl.length() - 1; i >= 0 && shown < 80; i--, shown++) {
                String one = fl.optString(i, "");
                int bar = one.indexOf('|');
                if (bar > 0) one = one.substring(bar + 1);   // 去掉首段的 hash 键
                sb.append(one).append('\n');
            }
            if (fl.length() > 80) sb.append("…共 ").append(fl.length()).append(" 条");
            new android.app.AlertDialog.Builder(a)
                    .setTitle("伪赞记录（" + fl.length() + "）")
                    .setMessage(sb.toString())
                    .setPositiveButton("清空", new android.content.DialogInterface.OnClickListener() {
                        @Override public void onClick(android.content.DialogInterface d, int w) {
                            try {
                                org.json.JSONObject o = readCfg();
                                o.put("fakeLiked", new org.json.JSONArray());
                                writeCfg(o);
                                cfg = null; cfgAt = 0;
                                toast("已清空伪赞记录");
                            } catch (Throwable ignore) { }
                        }
                    })
                    .setNegativeButton("关闭", null).show();
        } catch (Throwable t) { toast("读取失败"); }
    }

    /** 记一条伪赞（最多 300 条），供「伪赞记录」查看 */
    static void fakeLikeRecord(String txt) {
        try {
            org.json.JSONArray fl = cfg().optJSONArray("fakeLiked");
            if (fl == null) fl = new org.json.JSONArray();
            String one = String.valueOf(txt.hashCode()) + "|"
                    + new java.text.SimpleDateFormat("MM-dd HH:mm", java.util.Locale.US)
                    .format(new java.util.Date()) + "|"
                    + (txt.length() > 60 ? txt.substring(0, 60) : txt);
            fl.put(one);
            while (fl.length() > 300) {
                org.json.JSONArray n2 = new org.json.JSONArray();
                for (int i = 1; i < fl.length(); i++) n2.put(fl.optString(i));
                fl = n2;
            }
            org.json.JSONObject o = readCfg();
            o.put("fakeLiked", fl);
            writeCfg(o);
            cfg = null; cfgAt = 0;
            log("FAKELIKE|rec " + one);
        } catch (Throwable ignore) { }
    }

    // ================= 恢复块 2 =================
    private static Object ensureDb() {
        Object db = dbRef;
        if (db != null) return db;
        try {
            Object store = null;
            Object found = null;
            // w41.i9 这类混淆类名每个微信版本都可能变，探测失败要能继续走兜底
            try {
                Object f = Class.forName("w41.i9", false, appCl).getMethod("b").invoke(null);
                store = f.getClass().getMethod("v").invoke(f);
                found = findDbIn(store);
            } catch (Throwable t1) {
                if (dbLogGate()) log("ENSURE_DB|class-probe skip " + t1.getClass().getSimpleName() + " " + t1.getCause());
            }
            if (found != null) {
                dbRef = found;
                log("ENSURE_DB|ok");
                return found;
            }
            // 兜底 1：从 rawQuery 见过的候选库里实探
            synchronized (dbCandidates) {
                for (int i = 0; i < dbCandidates.size(); i++) {
                    Object cand = dbCandidates.get(i);
                    if (cand == null) continue;
                    try {
                        dbProbing = true;
                        Object cur = null;
                        for (Method m : cand.getClass().getMethods()) {
                            if (!m.getName().equals("rawQuery")) continue;
                            Class<?>[] ps = m.getParameterTypes();
                            if (ps.length != 2 || ps[0] != String.class) continue;
                            Object arg = (ps[1] == String[].class) ? new String[0] : new Object[0];
                            cur = m.invoke(cand, "select count(*) from message", arg);
                            break;
                        }
                        if (cur != null) {
                            boolean ok = (Boolean) cur.getClass().getMethod("moveToNext").invoke(cur);
                            try { cur.getClass().getMethod("close").invoke(cur); } catch (Throwable ignore) { }
                            if (ok) {
                                dbRef = cand;
                                log("ENSURE_DB|ok(probe#" + i + ")");
                                return cand;
                            }
                        }
                    } catch (Throwable ignore) {
                    } finally { dbProbing = false; }
                }
            }
            // 兜底 2：store.r 字段就是消息库句柄
            try {
                Object h = store.getClass().getField("r").get(store);
                if (h != null) {
                    dbRef = h;
                    log("ENSURE_DB|ok(handle) " + h.getClass().getName());
                    return h;
                }
            } catch (Throwable ignore) { }
            if (dbLogGate()) log("ENSURE_DB|store=" + (store == null ? "null" : store.getClass().getName()));
            return null;
        } catch (Throwable t) {
            log("ENSURE_DB|err " + t);
            return null;
        }
    }

